7478dfbb-0215-44c3-add5-ef5c7c69278d	2e2ae20a-832b-4e7c-9419-2afdb506b6ab	\N	Kayak Tour to Ponta da Piedade Caves	\N	activity	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	https://maps.google.com/?q=Praia+da+Batata+Lagos	\N	\N	\N	\N	USD	\N	\N	f	\N	t	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	999	\N	2026-02-06 17:40:07.434691+00	2026-02-06 17:40:07.434691+00	\N	\N	\N	\N	a1b7f971-5501-49e2-b844-04ae39975f13	optional	unconfirmed	\N	\N	4f5d2d2f-c4d2-4427-95f4-1e5facc954da	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	f	\N	{}	{"parker": {"scripts": ["You're going to paddle a real kayak into sea caves! The guides will show you how to steer, and you'll go places even the tour boats can't reach."], "age_at_trip": 8}, "charlotte": {"scripts": ["You and Mommy/Daddy are going to paddle a boat together into secret caves! If you get tired, the guides have a motorboat that can help."], "age_at_trip": 5}}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	{"what_it_is": "Guided kayak tours launch from Batata Beach and paddle to Ponta da Piedade caves, entering grottos too narrow for motor boats. Double kayaks allow parent + child paddling together. Support motorboat always nearby.", "why_it_matters": "More immersive and active than boat tour—you paddle yourself into the caves. Gets into smaller spaces boats can't reach."}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	direct_replacement	Want more active adventure; Parker wants a physical challenge; calm seas; family wants to split up	Age minimum is 5 years, which excludes Xander (3). Would require splitting the family—one parent with Xander doing something else while other parent takes Parker and Charlotte kayaking. Chose boat tour because it's inclusive for the whole family and still delivers the cave experience.
