, gentle gradient, Roman milestones for natural rest stops with built-in education, and waterfall pool reward at the end. The milestones aren't reproductions but actual 2,000-year-old stones with legible inscriptions."}, "interesting_facts": ["This section has more Roman milestones than any comparable road in the former Roman Empire", "Wheel ruts were worn by 2,000 years of cart traffic", "Some oaks here may be 800+ years old"]}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
