on", "Portuguese mountain horses developed sure-footedness over centuries", "Traditional horse fairs date to medieval times"]}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
