st point, fortified by every civilization that occupied the city. The 1147 siege that won the castle for Portugal is a genuine medieval action story—complete with a knight who sacrificed himself by jamming his body in a gate.", "interesting_facts": ["Site fortified for 2,000+ years", "Vasco da Gama received here after India voyage", "Peacocks are intentional—royalty kept them as wealth symbols"]}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
