 "why_it_matters": "If Pena Palace is a fairy tale, Quinta da Regaleira is a mystery novel carved in stone. For kids, it delivers what fantasy books promise: actual secret tunnels, an underground well spiraling into darkness, hidden passages emerging into sunlight, stepping stones across a lake.", "interesting_facts": ["27-meter deep Initiation Well", "Four tunnels lead to different garden points", "Only six years to build (1904-1910)"]}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
