noceros based on real animal", "Tower originally stood in middle of river—shoreline shifted", "Dürer's famous woodcut based on same rhino"]}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N
