sonry and Knights Templar.", "why_it_matters": "If Pena Palace is a fairy tale, Quinta da Regaleira is a mystery novel carved in stone. For kids, it delivers what fantasy books promise: actual secret tunnels, an underground well spiraling into darkness, hidden passages emerging into sunlight, stepping stones across a lake.", "interesting_facts": ["27-meter deep Initiation Well", "Four tunnels lead to different garden points", "Only six years to build (1904-1910)"]}	[{"tip": "Lay phone on ground pointing up", "shot": "Looking up from well bottom", "where": "Center of compass floor"}, {"shot": "Kids emerging from tunnel", "where": "Waterfall exit most dramatic"}]	{"cost": {"adult": "€15", "child": "€10 (6-17), FREE under 5", "family_total": "€40"}, "tips": ["Head DIRECTLY to Initiation Well upon entry", "Tunnels NOT truly dark—atmospheric", "Bring phone flashlight for extra fun"], "hours": "10:00am-7:30pm daily.", "stroller": "NOT stroller-friendly. Steep paths, narrow tunnels. Carrier essential.", "best_time": "Opening at 10am", "reservation": {"url": "https://regaleira.byblueticket.pt/", "required": true}, "time_needed": "2-2.5 hours"}	{"area": "Sintra", "address": "Rua Barbosa du Bocage, 2710-567 Sintra", "latitude": 38.7965, "longitude": -9.3959}	\N	11:15am-1:15pm
