hTimeDescription": "3 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJj3ImONYHloAR4_qdimtpnzQ/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKd2FVTk9ZMWRoYm5WWlRuVlNNMVpUTkRscE1GRRAB", "text": {"text": "Literally the most beautiful lake I've ever seen. I cannot wait to come back here again.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-10-14T01:33:59.311586415Z", "originalText": {"text": "Literally the most beautiful lake I've ever seen. I cannot wait to come back here again.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKd2FVTk9ZMWRoYm5WWlRuVlNNMVpUTkRscE1GRRAB!2m1!1s0x809607d63826728f:0x349f696b8a9dfae3", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xKd2FVTk9ZMWRoYm5WWlRuVlNNMVpUTkRscE1GRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107386067726876482418/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJVYecBFR66_IxxBR4z7sAcz6l2oFHK-sVs_9I9UQabHAF5tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4", "displayName": "Ashlie Grasa"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago"}]	Convict Lake is universally praised as a stunning mountain destination that offers something for everyone, from families seeking peaceful picnics to hikers wanting scenic loop trails. Visitors consistently highlight the crystal-clear water, dramatic mountain backdrops, and picture-perfect reflections that make it a must-see gem in the Mammoth area. The location provides easy access and facilities while maintaining a peaceful, family-friendly atmosphere.	{"summary": "Convict Lake is universally praised as a stunning mountain destination that offers something for everyone, from families seeking peaceful picnics to hikers wanting scenic loop trails. Visitors consistently highlight the crystal-clear water, dramatic mountain backdrops, and picture-perfect reflections that make it a must-see gem in the Mammoth area. The location 