1a2e9fd7-f6ab-4cfe-8366-b997970bc70d	b201a860-05a3-4ddc-bb89-4c4271177271	Paso Robles Wine Country via Sun Outdoors Resort	Sun Outdoors Paso Robles (formerly Cava Robles) won national awards for campground design. Premium full-hookup sites on concrete or DG pads accommodate big rigs easily. The resort hosts wine events, tastings, and winery tours. Field of Light at Sensorio (58,000 fiber-optic spheres) creates unforgettable evening experiences.	A luxury RV resort that feels like a boutique hotel—on-site wine tasting, Farmhouse Bistro, fire pits for romantic evenings—with 250+ wineries in short driving distance.	couples_getaway	\N	2500 Airport Rd, Paso Robles, CA 93446, USA	Paso Robles	CA	35.6467120	-120.6399955	ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec	4.3	711	\N	{"hookups": "full", "road_accessibility": "Premium full-hookup sites on concrete or DG pads accommodate big rigs easily"}	f	\N	\N	60.00	USD	$60-100+/night. Book well ahead for weekends, especially September-November harvest season	{"best": ["september", "october", "november"], "notes": "Harvest season peak"}	3.5 hours	\N	{"scenic_beauty": 4, "solitude_level": 2, "adventure_level": 2, "family_friendly": 4, "relaxation_factor": 5}	\N	{"parker": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Ravine Water Park (walking distance)"], "engagement_level": 3}, "xander": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Pool activities"], "engagement_level": 3}, "charlotte": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Field of Light at Sensorio"], "engagement_level": 3}}	https://www.sunoutdoors.com/california/sun-outdoors-central-coast-wine-country?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp_listing	(805) 238-4560	\N	researching	0	{luxury,wine-country,couples,adults-preferred}	{}	{}	\N	\N	2026-02-02 15:20:34.823+00	2026-02-06 04:03:55.007457+00	[{"name": "places/ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZM01tWnRaSEp4ZVdJdFIyMUpVbTEwTlVsT09GRRAB", "text": {"text": "I’ve stayed here a couple of times now with my travel trailer and have enjoyed the property. Overall the property is well maintained with spotless bathrooms, smart app washers/dryers, pool and hot tub. Staff has always been friendly and professional. I’ll definitely staying here again soon.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-12-19T02:30:52.440306382Z", "originalText": {"text": "I’ve stayed here a couple of times now with my travel trailer and have enjoyed the property. Overall the property is well maintained with spotless bathrooms, smart app washers/dryers, pool and hot tub. Staff has always been friendly and professional. I’ll definitely staying here again soon.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZM01tWnRaSEp4ZVdJdFIyMUpVbTEwTlVsT09GRRAB!2m1!1s0x80ecc5f4e2a38fc7:0xe7e98ba788bf0e3c", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pZM01tWnRaSEp4ZVdJdFIyMUpVbTEwTlVsT09GRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114078507984810228576/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXJ02RYTi2Qj--zEdxkcwYbyTEJ1DWXxLUCmRGe54IeWYfHfBHR=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Arnold de Jesus"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWT1gyZHdNemxDYjFOd01FMUxWUzFYVkZscVJuYxAB", "text": {"text": "Never experienced this in my life!\\n\\nI called them 2 weeks prior to check in and they couldn't move my reservation to their sister Sun outdoors rv park that is literally 2 mins away across the road, called\\nSun outdoors Paso Robles.\\n\\nThey even went on further, to provide my bank a set of documents to support the case worth $100... the lady on reception doesn't understand cost benefit concept.\\n\\nRidiculous customer service especially when we are talking about same owner properties across the road. Be aware", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 1, "publishTime": "2025-12-09T08:34:20.566154589Z", "originalText": {"text": "Never experienced this in my life!\\n\\nI called them 2 weeks prior to check in and they couldn't move my reservation to their sister Sun outdoors rv park that is literally 2 mins away across the road, called\\nSun outdoors Paso Robles.\\n\\nThey even went on further, to provide my bank a set of documents to support the case worth $100... the lady on reception doesn't understand cost benefit concept.\\n\\nRidiculous customer service especially when we are talking about same owner properties across the road. Be aware", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWT1gyZHdNemxDYjFOd01FMUxWUzFYVkZscVJuYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecc5f4e2a38fc7:0xe7e98ba788bf0e3c", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pWT1gyZHdNemxDYjFOd01FMUxWUzFYVkZscVJuYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111372576404728585802/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpGHkjJ72m_mqsa7KaUTBaxvQfmo1TyR6rfYl4PgR5n_0K2Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Frank McGinney"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taVFlsSmplalJxWkhORE0wVjFVbTF3Yms5TVkzYxAB", "text": {"text": "We stayed in one of their cottages. Really nice. Very clean, lots of amenities. We got the one bedroom.  The bedroom is a touch small, but there is also a loft that serves as an extra bedroom.  Would definitely stay again.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-11-06T14:39:21.789911832Z", "originalText": {"text": "We stayed in one of their cottages. Really nice. Very clean, lots of amenities. We got the one bedroom.  The bedroom is a touch small, but there is also a loft that serves as an extra bedroom.  Would definitely stay again.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taVFlsSmplalJxWkhORE0wVjFVbTF3Yms5TVkzYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecc5f4e2a38fc7:0xe7e98ba788bf0e3c", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taVFlsSmplalJxWkhORE0wVjFVbTF3Yms5TVkzYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115176632628505514277/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLOieHv0IIRlE5EDJB9U2BD3MI7HHN3x5n0K1-act3b4Pz_Dg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "STEVE F"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkV1VIQktiV05RVlU5Uk9VdzFTV2RaZEV3elYyYxAB", "text": {"text": "I have stayed at wine country resort in Paso Robles numerous time over the years and have had great times. The wine bar is a fun place to meet new people.\\nI have called the main phone line four  times in the past three days to inquire about the smoke due to the fires in the area.\\nWe don’t want to drive 4 hours the be in a smoky area. My calls have gone to the main office line without a return call.\\nIt’s too bad someone can’t take 5 minutes to return a long time customers phone call and give the information requested.\\nWe were looking to spend 5 days at the resort and due several day trips.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 3, "publishTime": "2025-08-11T22:34:46.892869825Z", "originalText": {"text": "I have stayed at wine country resort in Paso Robles numerous time over the years and have had great times. The wine bar is a fun place to meet new people.\\nI have called the main phone line four  times in the past three days to inquire about the smoke due to the fires in the area.\\nWe don’t want to drive 4 hours the be in a smoky area. My calls have gone to the main office line without a return call.\\nIt’s too bad someone can’t take 5 minutes to return a long time customers phone call and give the information requested.\\nWe were looking to spend 5 days at the resort and due several day trips.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkV1VIQktiV05RVlU5Uk9VdzFTV2RaZEV3elYyYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecc5f4e2a38fc7:0xe7e98ba788bf0e3c", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkV1VIQktiV05RVlU5Uk9VdzFTV2RaZEV3elYyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107243827172299551238/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJS_gqyjYy3UcSe0AqlgVjdh81Mq-p6nfpd3q-odu817x8mLw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "tom read"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJx4-j4vTF7IARPA6_iKeL6ec/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKNFZ6SlpPRmRSYm01MWJXSnVkblptVFZobU5FRRAB", "text": {"text": "Terrible experience. The campground was dirty and poorly maintained. My family and I chose to stay here because we had many great visits when I was younger, but unfortunately the quality has gone downhill. At our campsite, my dad slipped in the mud caused by overwatering. When we reported it to the staff, nothing was done to address the issue and we didn’t even receive an apology. Because of this incident, my dad injured his leg and required medical attention.\\n\\nThe bathrooms were also unacceptable—stained shower curtains, hair, and filth throughout. The pool wasn’t any better, with visible layers of grime along the waterline. Overall, this was an extremely disappointing and unsafe experience.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 1, "publishTime": "2025-09-07T19:12:48.474282976Z", "originalText": {"text": "Terrible experience. The campground was dirty and poorly maintained. My family and I chose to stay here because we had many great visits when I was younger, but unfortunately the quality has gone downhill. At our campsite, my dad slipped in the mud caused by overwatering. When we reported it to the staff, nothing was done to address the issue and we didn’t even receive an apology. Because of this incident, my dad injured his leg and required medical attention.\\n\\nThe bathrooms were also unacceptable—stained shower curtains, hair, and filth throughout. The pool wasn’t any better, with visible layers of grime along the waterline. Overall, this was an extremely disappointing and unsafe experience.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKNFZ6SlpPRmRSYm01MWJXSnVkblptVFZobU5FRRAB!2m1!1s0x80ecc5f4e2a38fc7:0xe7e98ba788bf0e3c", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKNFZ6SlpPRmRSYm01MWJXSnVkblptVFZobU5FRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102201384818389874386/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVRouEhNvJvYJ0YSy50cwwXlQTCZ88hPn8bPwE6OrZff140SX42=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Tori C"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago"}]	This Paso Robles resort receives mixed reviews, with guests praising the clean facilities, friendly staff, and nice cottages when maintained properly. However, there are significant concerns about declining maintenance standards, poor customer service, and safety issues that have left some longtime visitors disappointed.	{"summary": "This Paso Robles resort receives mixed reviews, with guests praising the clean facilities, friendly staff, and nice cottages when maintained properly. However, there are significant concerns about declining maintenance standards, poor customer service, and safety issues that have left some longtime visitors disappointed.", "negative": [{"text": "The bathrooms were also unacceptable—stained shower curtains, hair, and filth throughout. The pool wasn't any better, with visible layers of grime along the waterline.", "author": "Tori C", "rating": 1}, {"text": "At our campsite, my dad slipped in the mud caused by overwatering. When we reported it to the staff, nothing was done to address the issue.", "author": "Tori C", "rating": 1}], "positive": [{"text": "Overall the property is well maintained with spotless bathrooms, smart app washers/dryers, pool and hot tub.", "author": "Arnold de Jesus", "rating": 5}, {"text": "We stayed in one of their cottages. Really nice. Very clean, lots of amenities.", "author": "STEVE F", "rating": 5}], "last_updated": "2026-02-06T04:03:54.927Z"}	2026-02-06 04:03:47.728+00	private_rv_park	\N	\N
201b584f-0351-458f-a337-b836276420e3	b201a860-05a3-4ddc-bb89-4c4271177271	Petrified Forest / Painted Desert via Holbrook KOA	The park has no camping—gates lock at sunset to prevent petrified wood theft. Base at Holbrook/Petrified Forest KOA (20 miles, full hookups, pool, playground, $35-50/night) or Crystal Forest Gift Shop (adjacent to park, electric hookups $25). The 28-mile scenic drive handles large RVs perfectly—no tight turns or tunnels.	Walk through a 225-million-year-old forest turned to rainbow stone, decode 2,000-year-old petroglyphs, and watch the Painted Desert glow at sunset—all at the only National Park that closes every night.	national_parks	\N	102 Hermosa Dr, Holbrook, AZ 86025, USA	Holbrook	AZ	34.9234145	-110.1437659	ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y	4.2	1345	\N	{"hookups": "full", "cell_coverage": "good", "road_accessibility": "28-mile scenic drive handles large RVs perfectly—no tight turns or tunnels"}	f	\N	\N	35.00	USD	KOA $35-50/night (20 miles). Crystal Forest Gift Shop $25 (adjacent)	{"best": ["march", "april", "may", "september", "october", "november"], "notes": "High desert means layers required"}	7-8 hours	\N	{"scenic_beauty": 5, "solitude_level": 3, "adventure_level": 4, "family_friendly": 5, "relaxation_factor": 3}	{"topics": ["Geology", "Paleontology", "Puebloan culture", "Fossilization processes"], "visitor_center": true, "junior_ranger_program": true}	{"parker": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Decoding petroglyph symbols", "Identifying minerals in petrified logs"], "engagement_level": 5}, "xander": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Walking flat trails", "Spotting pronghorn and prairie dogs", "Colorful landscape"], "engagement_level": 4}, "charlotte": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Hunting for 'rainbow logs'", "Touching 225-million-year-old wood"], "engagement_level": 5}}	https://koa.com/campgrounds/holbrook/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp	(800) 562-3389	\N	researching	0	{national-park,petroglyphs,fossils,painted-desert}	{"Rainbow petrified wood","2,000-year-old petroglyphs","Easy RV driving"}	{"No in-park camping","Park closes at sunset"}	Critical rule: Do NOT take any petrified wood—federal offense. Buy legally collected pieces at gift shops	\N	2026-02-02 15:20:41.047+00	2026-02-06 03:46:15.206999+00	[{"name": "places/ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pReGVERlZUblU0TlRaM04xQlllbll0UzI5RWVXYxAB", "text": {"text": "We  enjoyed  our  overnight  stay  here.  The  deluxe tent campsites  were  well  worth  the  somewhat  higher  price.  These  go  fast  as  there  are  only  two  sites  available.  It  was  nice  to  have  the  amenities  that  normally are only associated  with  RV's. If  you  stay  here,  do  not  miss  the  breakfast  service  which  was  good  and  very  reasonably  priced. The  only thing  we  found  less  than  perfect  was  the  location  of  electrical  outlets which  were  far  from  the  actual  tent  pads  and  requiring  a long (", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-12-24T07:50:00.382426662Z", "originalText": {"text": "We  enjoyed  our  overnight  stay  here.  The  deluxe tent campsites  were  well  worth  the  somewhat  higher  price.  These  go  fast  as  there  are  only  two  sites  available.  It  was  nice  to  have  the  amenities  that  normally are only associated  with  RV's. If  you  stay  here,  do  not  miss  the  breakfast  service  which  was  good  and  very  reasonably  priced. The  only thing  we  found  less  than  perfect  was  the  location  of  electrical  outlets which  were  far  from  the  actual  tent  pads  and  requiring  a long (", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pReGVERlZUblU0TlRaM04xQlllbll0UzI5RWVXYxAB!2m1!1s0x872fa87729a7a6b1:0x766fddf63281d50e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pReGVERlZUblU0TlRaM04xQlllbll0UzI5RWVXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100851642105374038463/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWW28pAGSVWdm0LSKb-PHKJhGcjE4wmg4yOWPqPuS8Jgv52b84=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6", "displayName": "Den Usa"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psZlduWnZNRmRFT1ZsTWQwRlZaREZ2WW1GU2IxRRAB", "text": {"text": "I’ve stayed at a few different KOAs so far and I really liked the cabin I stayed in at this one. The space heater was really good, plus it had a microwave and a mini fridge. I also liked that it had the chair swing outside. Being so close to the bathrooms was also a plus.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2026-01-04T16:16:36.972622069Z", "originalText": {"text": "I’ve stayed at a few different KOAs so far and I really liked the cabin I stayed in at this one. The space heater was really good, plus it had a microwave and a mini fridge. I also liked that it had the chair swing outside. Being so close to the bathrooms was also a plus.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psZlduWnZNRmRFT1ZsTWQwRlZaREZ2WW1GU2IxRRAB!2m1!1s0x872fa87729a7a6b1:0x766fddf63281d50e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2psZlduWnZNRmRFT1ZsTWQwRlZaREZ2WW1GU2IxRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111365355604855802620/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVIzF2tHjnO4rg-bZ_lDP5GgCBmyIa_Du-9Z4ZWgH-M3nWLtRCz=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Shana Vaid"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKS1IwVXlhelJmYkZkMmVrZE9ka3hPV2xOeVlVRRAB", "text": {"text": "Booked a private patio site over 6 months in advance with a request to keep us as close to our 2 other traveling companions as possible. When we arrived, there was someone in our site, and our two companions were halfway across the park from us. No escorts, so a maintenance man helped us. Very friendly and helpful. Made multiple trips to the office. Moved us to a secondary patio site, smaller site, our rig didn't fit with the trailer, we had to store it off our site. Very inconvenient when I had called 3 weeks prior to verify we could have our trailer on our site because we keep our motorcycles in it. No compensation for the hour we wasted with all of this, or the inconvenience or the fact that they split us up. The rig in our assigned site was much smaller than ours, they were supposed to have checked out and didn't. They let them keep the bigger site an inconvenienced us.\\nAll that said, the park is neat and clean, the pool is great.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 4, "publishTime": "2025-10-14T16:06:18.952227415Z", "originalText": {"text": "Booked a private patio site over 6 months in advance with a request to keep us as close to our 2 other traveling companions as possible. When we arrived, there was someone in our site, and our two companions were halfway across the park from us. No escorts, so a maintenance man helped us. Very friendly and helpful. Made multiple trips to the office. Moved us to a secondary patio site, smaller site, our rig didn't fit with the trailer, we had to store it off our site. Very inconvenient when I had called 3 weeks prior to verify we could have our trailer on our site because we keep our motorcycles in it. No compensation for the hour we wasted with all of this, or the inconvenience or the fact that they split us up. The rig in our assigned site was much smaller than ours, they were supposed to have checked out and didn't. They let them keep the bigger site an inconvenienced us.\\nAll that said, the park is neat and clean, the pool is great.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKS1IwVXlhelJmYkZkMmVrZE9ka3hPV2xOeVlVRRAB!2m1!1s0x872fa87729a7a6b1:0x766fddf63281d50e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKS1IwVXlhelJmYkZkMmVrZE9ka3hPV2xOeVlVRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113550997680380879520/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVO6e23FeRdjMaJS0nFfotT-KlKE9MsNS80JBOdwQAw4txsc3s=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Karen Mohring"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQ05TMUdOblZtVDNrMVIyazFMVVprUVc5dlRtYxAB", "text": {"text": "This is a nice property with honest professional staff. There is no wifi, staff  told me there was none when I inquired.  In the front bathhouse 2 of the shower stalls don't drain well so you'll be standing in water and all the showerheads suck.  The back shower house is also nice but has low water pressure and takes several flushes. We had a pet pen that wasn't locked or clean when we arrived, I had not problem cleaning it but that was a key sign to have all your vaccinations and preventatives update to date. The dog walk is dirt so if it's wet it will be mud.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 4, "publishTime": "2025-09-09T15:33:06.839105395Z", "originalText": {"text": "This is a nice property with honest professional staff. There is no wifi, staff  told me there was none when I inquired.  In the front bathhouse 2 of the shower stalls don't drain well so you'll be standing in water and all the showerheads suck.  The back shower house is also nice but has low water pressure and takes several flushes. We had a pet pen that wasn't locked or clean when we arrived, I had not problem cleaning it but that was a key sign to have all your vaccinations and preventatives update to date. The dog walk is dirt so if it's wet it will be mud.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQ05TMUdOblZtVDNrMVIyazFMVVprUVc5dlRtYxAB!2m1!1s0x872fa87729a7a6b1:0x766fddf63281d50e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21wQ05TMUdOblZtVDNrMVIyazFMVVprUVc5dlRtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104421016356945083238/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWjQxDHZn9pwIvT90Nqjs1BvB8cCY0W6-ReRcd8Pi_wbgac6VLXvw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5", "displayName": "Dawn Page-Thurmond"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJsaanKXeoL4cRDtWBMvbdb3Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWalMycEhlbko2WVVobk1UWktla0ZqWjFSdloyYxAB", "text": {"text": "This place is in Good location. We have booked Deluxe Cabin, was good but up stairs was for very short highted ppl. No head clearance to walk or to stand for 4+ feet ppl. 1 queen and 1 full size mattress was there in upstairs.\\nDownstairs Room had all other amenities 1 queen size bed. Bunk bed was there to sleep for 2 kids. Other amenities like kitchen, Bathroom, dinning table, couches and chairs was there in cabin.\\nOut side room had table Chairs, Barbecue, Fireplace.\\nThere are Kids play area and swimming pool. All though pool was not cleaned and filter system was not on.\\n\\nOverall fine to stay there.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 4, "publishTime": "2025-09-22T20:15:39.167952649Z", "originalText": {"text": "This place is in Good location. We have booked Deluxe Cabin, was good but up stairs was for very short highted ppl. No head clearance to walk or to stand for 4+ feet ppl. 1 queen and 1 full size mattress was there in upstairs.\\nDownstairs Room had all other amenities 1 queen size bed. Bunk bed was there to sleep for 2 kids. Other amenities like kitchen, Bathroom, dinning table, couches and chairs was there in cabin.\\nOut side room had table Chairs, Barbecue, Fireplace.\\nThere are Kids play area and swimming pool. All though pool was not cleaned and filter system was not on.\\n\\nOverall fine to stay there.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWalMycEhlbko2WVVobk1UWktla0ZqWjFSdloyYxAB!2m1!1s0x872fa87729a7a6b1:0x766fddf63281d50e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xWalMycEhlbko2WVVobk1UWktla0ZqWjFSdloyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113841211561951148044/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI_JpccUop5NYZn_Tiw37fuV1e4Ah5ntN86Whfch4G9OlVX1w=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6", "displayName": "Ashish D"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}]	This KOA offers solid accommodations with well-equipped cabins and deluxe tent sites, though guests frequently encounter maintenance issues and operational challenges. Families appreciate the amenities like pools and play areas, but should expect some inconveniences with facilities and service coordination. The location provides good access to the Petrified Forest, making it a functional base despite its imperfections.	{"summary": "This KOA offers solid accommodations with well-equipped cabins and deluxe tent sites, though guests frequently encounter maintenance issues and operational challenges. Families appreciate the amenities like pools and play areas, but should expect some inconveniences with facilities and service coordination. The location provides good access to the Petrified Forest, making it a functional base despite its imperfections.", "negative": [{"text": "Pool was not cleaned and filter system was not on.", "author": "Ashish D", "rating": 4}, {"text": "In the front bathhouse 2 of the shower stalls don't drain well so you'll be standing in water and all the showerheads suck.", "author": "Dawn Page-Thurmond", "rating": 4}], "positive": [{"text": "The space heater was really good, plus it had a microwave and a mini fridge. I also liked that it had the chair swing outside.", "author": "Shana Vaid", "rating": 5}, {"text": "There are Kids play area and swimming pool.", "author": "Ashish D", "rating": 4}, {"text": "The deluxe tent campsites were well worth the somewhat higher price. It was nice to have the amenities that normally are only associated with RV's.", "author": "Den Usa", "rating": 5}], "last_updated": "2026-02-06T03:46:15.093Z"}	2026-02-06 03:46:08.535+00	private_campground	\N	\N
0c1ca4a9-64a3-429d-8fc8-3027cdd06f27	b201a860-05a3-4ddc-bb89-4c4271177271	Shaver Lake via Camp Edison	Camp Edison at Shaver Lake accepts RVs up to 78 feet and offers boat launch, marina, beach access, camp store, laundry, and hot showers. Unlike most Sierra camping, you get hookups AND natural beauty. Dinkey Creek's natural swimming holes ('The Slicks' and 'Honeymoon Pool') feature granite-carved pools 25 minutes away.	One of California's most popular campgrounds for good reason—43 sites with full hookups (30/50 amp, cable TV, WiFi), gorgeous pine forest, warmer water than high-elevation lakes, and nearby McKinley Grove of Giant Sequoias.	lake_river	\N	42696 Tollhouse Rd, Shaver Lake, CA 93664, USA	Shaver Lake	CA	37.1220511	-119.3105172	ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA	4.7	970	\N	{"hookups": "full", "cell_coverage": "good", "max_trailer_length_ft": 78}	t	\N	\N	75.00	USD	$75-105/night full hookup sites	{"best": ["may", "june", "july", "august", "september"], "notes": "Memorial Day-Labor Day operation"}	4.5-5 hours	\N	{"scenic_beauty": 5, "solitude_level": 2, "adventure_level": 4, "family_friendly": 5, "relaxation_factor": 5}	\N	{"parker": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Exploring 35 miles of hiking trails"], "engagement_level": 5}, "xander": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Warm shallow water at beach", "Pine cone collecting"], "engagement_level": 5}, "charlotte": {"suitable": true, "activities": ["Camp store visits", "Nature walks"], "engagement_level": 4}}	https://www.camplife.com/314/reservation/step1	(559) 841-3134 ext. 6	\N	researching	0	{full-hookups,sierra,lake,sequoias,premier-camping}	{"78-foot RV capacity","Full hookups with WiFi/cable","Warmer water than high-elevation lakes"}	{"Books within hours in January"}	\N	\N	2026-02-02 15:20:39.708+00	2026-02-06 03:48:35.206869+00	[{"name": "places/ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205R1gzcFlXWEpyTFhsaE5tOTZXbHB3U201MGFWRRAB", "text": {"text": "We had a fantastic stay at Camp Edison! We stayed in a trailer with full hook-ups, and everything worked perfectly. The back-in sites were easy to access and spaced appropriately, giving us a comfortable amount of privacy.\\n\\nThe entire campground was beautiful and well-maintained. The bathrooms stood out—they were very clean and looked freshly painted, which we really appreciated.\\n\\nOur kids had an absolute blast exploring the area, and even though our first night brought a full-on thunder and lightning storm, it made the experience even more memorable.\\n\\nOverall, Camp Edison is a great spot for families looking for a scenic, clean, and well-run campground. We’ll definitely be back!", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-10-04T02:15:22.557679645Z", "originalText": {"text": "We had a fantastic stay at Camp Edison! We stayed in a trailer with full hook-ups, and everything worked perfectly. The back-in sites were easy to access and spaced appropriately, giving us a comfortable amount of privacy.\\n\\nThe entire campground was beautiful and well-maintained. The bathrooms stood out—they were very clean and looked freshly painted, which we really appreciated.\\n\\nOur kids had an absolute blast exploring the area, and even though our first night brought a full-on thunder and lightning storm, it made the experience even more memorable.\\n\\nOverall, Camp Edison is a great spot for families looking for a scenic, clean, and well-run campground. We’ll definitely be back!", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205R1gzcFlXWEpyTFhsaE5tOTZXbHB3U201MGFWRRAB!2m1!1s0x8095b61dc769f98f:0x30b3d8a3d9014366", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT205R1gzcFlXWEpyTFhsaE5tOTZXbHB3U201MGFWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111887820131063735614/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX20jGSEeMh1APyskD4bcSlxxUQo-vmXZ2AMwJJ9jJgs6p2lYk=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Casey Morrow"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213eFUwbFZkVlZKTW5sdFNHUk5VRmxUY1ZSbGJtYxAB", "text": {"text": "We went on 7/25/2025. Camping area was nice. Bathroom were kept clean. There’s a small store that carries anything you might forgot to pack. When we got there was late at night. The people when we arrived at the booth were extra nice, very informative. Can’t say that about the lady that took our check out permit. When we left our campsite we when down to the beach just to check it out and maybe stay for a bit more since check out is 10 or 11 don’t remember. We decided not to because there was a lot of people. When we were driving out Edison the check out lady was very rude and said how we got away with that, not got caught and fined! Like we knew we weren’t supposed to do that! I thought you were just to check out from your camping site not the whole Camp Edison. Years ago we did the same thing and nobody said nothing so we thought it was ok. I just feel there’s better ways to talk to people and she definitely something else. Should be retrain for sure! I kind of got racism vibes from her. I was so in shock that I forgot to get her name. That kind of ruin our experience there sadly. Some people shouldn’t work with the public. Don’t know if we’ll be back. Overall Camp Edison is beautiful.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 3, "publishTime": "2025-08-26T01:25:34.609479243Z", "originalText": {"text": "We went on 7/25/2025. Camping area was nice. Bathroom were kept clean. There’s a small store that carries anything you might forgot to pack. When we got there was late at night. The people when we arrived at the booth were extra nice, very informative. Can’t say that about the lady that took our check out permit. When we left our campsite we when down to the beach just to check it out and maybe stay for a bit more since check out is 10 or 11 don’t remember. We decided not to because there was a lot of people. When we were driving out Edison the check out lady was very rude and said how we got away with that, not got caught and fined! Like we knew we weren’t supposed to do that! I thought you were just to check out from your camping site not the whole Camp Edison. Years ago we did the same thing and nobody said nothing so we thought it was ok. I just feel there’s better ways to talk to people and she definitely something else. Should be retrain for sure! I kind of got racism vibes from her. I was so in shock that I forgot to get her name. That kind of ruin our experience there sadly. Some people shouldn’t work with the public. Don’t know if we’ll be back. Overall Camp Edison is beautiful.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213eFUwbFZkVlZKTW5sdFNHUk5VRmxUY1ZSbGJtYxAB!2m1!1s0x8095b61dc769f98f:0x30b3d8a3d9014366", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT213eFUwbFZkVlZKTW5sdFNHUk5VRmxUY1ZSbGJtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106732973589336397082/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIYjcea4HNnxwC18HUnhn8ZB184UHn9JaJ6NBHo4fkzigAxDw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Luisana Alvarez Calles"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkSVdGUnBlR2MxT1RCNmQxbzFhbUl4ZVZKS1pFRRAB", "text": {"text": "Camp Edison in Shaver, CA is one of my favorite places to stay! The campground is clean, well-maintained, and surrounded by the most beautiful scenery. The sites are spacious and well-kept, with plenty of shade and easy access to the lake. Staff is friendly and helpful, making check-in a breeze. Whether you’re camping with family or friends, it’s the perfect mix of relaxation and outdoor fun. It’s my favorite place!", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-08-12T02:47:52.187323486Z", "originalText": {"text": "Camp Edison in Shaver, CA is one of my favorite places to stay! The campground is clean, well-maintained, and surrounded by the most beautiful scenery. The sites are spacious and well-kept, with plenty of shade and easy access to the lake. Staff is friendly and helpful, making check-in a breeze. Whether you’re camping with family or friends, it’s the perfect mix of relaxation and outdoor fun. It’s my favorite place!", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkSVdGUnBlR2MxT1RCNmQxbzFhbUl4ZVZKS1pFRRAB!2m1!1s0x8095b61dc769f98f:0x30b3d8a3d9014366", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tkSVdGUnBlR2MxT1RCNmQxbzFhbUl4ZVZKS1pFRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106010721043323714490/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVl8byRux7yK3yBj_fm8kFJZTGlBVDpkK82ID6HdTNLukVR3vlIpw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2", "displayName": "Marie Staggs"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsbFEzZG5VazlaV0dOblV6bDVRakJLY1c5RmExRRAB", "text": {"text": "Best camping Experience ever. Lake is walking distance from every campsite. You can pretty much fish and swim at every spot along the shore. Every campsite has power and running water. Also a truck full of wood passes by every night for 10$ dollars and bundle. There is a small market at the campground or you can go into town, just a short 5 min drive, to pick up ice, drinks, food , or any necessities you might have ran out of or forgotten to pack. Overall great experience and also my youngest daughter loves it here because she hasn’t seen any bears.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-08-04T01:02:08.612575404Z", "originalText": {"text": "Best camping Experience ever. Lake is walking distance from every campsite. You can pretty much fish and swim at every spot along the shore. Every campsite has power and running water. Also a truck full of wood passes by every night for 10$ dollars and bundle. There is a small market at the campground or you can go into town, just a short 5 min drive, to pick up ice, drinks, food , or any necessities you might have ran out of or forgotten to pack. Overall great experience and also my youngest daughter loves it here because she hasn’t seen any bears.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsbFEzZG5VazlaV0dOblV6bDVRakJLY1c5RmExRRAB!2m1!1s0x8095b61dc769f98f:0x30b3d8a3d9014366", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tsbFEzZG5VazlaV0dOblV6bDVRakJLY1c5RmExRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100877426637133456537/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIk1Qj5qlqEXmUq_kkCueLIDOj7KB1dMiSS2UJlKkRTmwwOCA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4", "displayName": "Rudy Vazquez"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJj_lpxx22lYARZkMB2aPYszA/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214a1IwRlRjRE5KZUc5MFUwVkVUbWh1ZEhoT1IyYxAB", "text": {"text": "RV’d next to lake, quiet, peacefully great view. Everyone was very nice from camp host to forrest personnel. Facilities were clean and accessible. Been here before will definitely return.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-09-06T00:12:21.741746646Z", "originalText": {"text": "RV’d next to lake, quiet, peacefully great view. Everyone was very nice from camp host to forrest personnel. Facilities were clean and accessible. Been here before will definitely return.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214a1IwRlRjRE5KZUc5MFUwVkVUbWh1ZEhoT1IyYxAB!2m1!1s0x8095b61dc769f98f:0x30b3d8a3d9014366", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT214a1IwRlRjRE5KZUc5MFUwVkVUbWh1ZEhoT1IyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110893223109998887120/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJ_u9J5JDpCUbRvRYm64toIPYvAROfDDlNNT3ntandZqObzNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Hank Rios"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 months ago"}]	Camp Edison at Shaver Lake is a highly-rated family campground that consistently impresses visitors with its clean, well-maintained facilities and beautiful lakeside setting. Families especially appreciate the spacious sites with full hookups, easy lake access for swimming and fishing, and kid-friendly atmosphere. While most experiences are overwhelmingly positive, some visitors have encountered issues with staff attitude during checkout.	{"summary": "Camp Edison at Shaver Lake is a highly-rated family campground that consistently impresses visitors with its clean, well-maintained facilities and beautiful lakeside setting. Families especially appreciate the spacious sites with full hookups, easy lake access for swimming and fishing, and kid-friendly atmosphere. While most experiences are overwhelmingly positive, some visitors have encountered issues with staff attitude during checkout.", "negative": [{"text": "When we left our campsite we when down to the beach just to check it out and maybe stay for a bit more since check out is 10 or 11 don't remember... the check out lady was very rude and said how we got away with that, not got caught and fined!", "author": "Luisana Alvarez Calles", "rating": 3}], "positive": [{"text": "Our kids had an absolute blast exploring 