94496279-3af8-4416-b67a-0a1b82cf1789	b201a860-05a3-4ddc-bb89-4c4271177271	Morro Strand State Beach	Nearby Morro Bay for sea otter watching, Hearst Castle 45 minutes, Paso Robles 30 minutes.	Campsites along the sand's edge with views of both ocean and iconic Morro Rock. Fall asleep to surf sounds.	couples_getaway	\N	Morro Strand State Beach, California 93442, USA	Morro Bay	CA	35.3918466	-120.8664024	ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg	4.7	430	\N	\N	t	\N	\N	35.00	USD	$35-65/night via ReserveCalifornia. Book 6 months ahead for oceanfront sites	\N	3.5 hours	\N	{"scenic_beauty": 5, "solitude_level": 3, "adventure_level": 2, "family_friendly": 4, "relaxation_factor": 5}	\N	\N	\N	\N	\N	researching	0	{couples,beachfront,morro-rock,oceanfront}	{}	{}	\N	\N	2026-02-02 15:20:43.841+00	2026-02-06 02:55:35.69557+00	[{"name": "places/ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wYU4zTTFNVlkwTldwM2JFSkpTRTR4UVVrelJtYxAB", "text": {"text": "Beautiful place. Parking is free and plentiful in the off season. There’s a sand path from the parking lot to the beach and would require a beach wheelchair if you use a chair", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-10-13T17:26:02.353474777Z", "originalText": {"text": "Beautiful place. Parking is free and plentiful in the off season. There’s a sand path from the parking lot to the beach and would require a beach wheelchair if you use a chair", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wYU4zTTFNVlkwTldwM2JFSkpTRTR4UVVrelJtYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ece04c0dc8138b:0x48c123594888388d", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25wYU4zTTFNVlkwTldwM2JFSkpTRTR4UVVrelJtYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103247882699927555688/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVBFPerpvJRubsz3i7OcVduJSeC1nEzaDdUyLTP4TjDy87IgUoPYA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5", "displayName": "Caty Wagner"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabFFsVjFWR1pZVEVJNGRXcHRUR1JmUm5KUU1XYxAB", "text": {"text": "Escape to the quieter side of the beach, away from the state park entrance, where you can walk, run, or simply enjoy peaceful bird watching and the soothing sounds of the surf. (Dogs are not allowed in this section.)\\n\\nFor those with bikes or furry companions, a scenic path runs alongside the shore.\\n\\nYou'll find free parking in a small lot.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-07-26T17:04:20.097928126Z", "originalText": {"text": "Escape to the quieter side of the beach, away from the state park entrance, where you can walk, run, or simply enjoy peaceful bird watching and the soothing sounds of the surf. (Dogs are not allowed in this section.)\\n\\nFor those with bikes or furry companions, a scenic path runs alongside the shore.\\n\\nYou'll find free parking in a small lot.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabFFsVjFWR1pZVEVJNGRXcHRUR1JmUm5KUU1XYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ece04c0dc8138b:0x48c123594888388d", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pabFFsVjFWR1pZVEVJNGRXcHRUR1JmUm5KUU1XYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116888271504189073402/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV9p9l1fGLWkFUfvQjDoCM22eMrOBLKkH5zxxH6NJE1c0pXfgNb=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6", "displayName": "Erin Kelley"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poV1dFNUJVRzlGZFUxblJsOURkRkZvTkVsaE4yYxAB", "text": {"text": "Such an amazing beach. Love the soft sand of the dunes as the beautiful backdrop for the beach. It's especially awesome because you can find TONS of sand dollars!!!", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-06-26T19:43:35.881877298Z", "originalText": {"text": "Such an amazing beach. Love the soft sand of the dunes as the beautiful backdrop for the beach. It's especially awesome because you can find TONS of sand dollars!!!", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poV1dFNUJVRzlGZFUxblJsOURkRkZvTkVsaE4yYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ece04c0dc8138b:0x48c123594888388d", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2poV1dFNUJVRzlGZFUxblJsOURkRkZvTkVsaE4yYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/103084596859448637845/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVhanlZbKMwfwG7KnajG_O3CO5HD6lT0Up4LL4thqSl9PZ8_k_UXw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4", "displayName": "Alison Jones"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "7 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vNFgwMTBMVTVyYkVWcFdGVjNaV1l5UzBRemRIYxAB", "text": {"text": "I REALLY don’t want any one else to show up here, but it is a great place to camp - esp if you want to run or bike into town. Close to cambria too.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-09-16T04:00:16.202957752Z", "originalText": {"text": "I REALLY don’t want any one else to show up here, but it is a great place to camp - esp if you want to run or bike into town. Close to cambria too.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vNFgwMTBMVTVyYkVWcFdGVjNaV1l5UzBRemRIYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ece04c0dc8138b:0x48c123594888388d", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21vNFgwMTBMVTVyYkVWcFdGVjNaV1l5UzBRemRIYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118276704343050292890/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLE039o5Qq7vbzcQG2XvqDfNZtnYQMJF19oo2siV-7jE0HwEA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2", "displayName": "Paul Egermeier"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJixPIDUzg7IARjTiISFkjwUg/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25vemVsbDJaWEZ6Y21ScFQxaHZUMVJIVDNGc2RWRRAB", "text": {"text": "Good campground, friendly staff, no showers though", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-09-30T18:07:41.953764902Z", "originalText": {"text": "Good campground, friendly staff, no showers though", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25vemVsbDJaWEZ6Y21ScFQxaHZUMVJIVDNGc2RWRRAB!2m1!1s0x80ece04c0dc8138b:0x48c123594888388d", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25vemVsbDJaWEZ6Y21ScFQxaHZUMVJIVDNGc2RWRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100270552677655391793/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW5Qp8zUqIYLql5PBiUBroCGY8yrJycRWHrMIq-ORCcU2Iuut2K=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5", "displayName": "4641HECA"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}]	Morro Strand State Beach is a beloved, quieter alternative to busier beaches with soft sand dunes, free parking, and unique opportunities like finding sand dollars. Visitors consistently praise its peaceful atmosphere for walking, running, and bird watching, though it requires walking on sand paths from parking to reach the beach.	{"summary": "Morro Strand State Beach is a beloved, quieter alternative to busier beaches with soft sand dunes, free parking, and unique opportunities like finding sand dollars. Visitors consistently praise its peaceful atmosphere for walking, running, and bird watching, though it requires walking on sand paths from parking to reach the beach.", "negative": [{"text": "There's a sand path from the parking lot to the beach and would require a beach wheelchair if you use a chair", "author": "Caty Wagner", "rating": 5}, {"text": "Good campground, friendly staff, no showers though", "author": "4641HECA", "rating": 5}], "positive": [{"text": "Love the soft sand of the dunes as the beautiful backdrop for the beach. It's especially awesome because you can find TONS of sand dollars!!!", "author": "Alison Jones", "rating": 5}, {"text": "Escape to the quieter side of the beach, away from the state park entrance, where you can walk, run, or simply enjoy peaceful bird watching and the soothing sounds of the surf.", "author": "Erin Kelley", "rating": 5}, {"text": "Parking is free and plentiful in the off season.", "author": "Caty Wagner", "rating": 5}], "last_updated": "2026-02-06T02:55:35.509Z"}	2026-02-06 02:55:30.04+00	state_park	\N	\N
a60abb80-380f-426e-bf7e-3edb4de5f7b1	b201a860-05a3-4ddc-bb89-4c4271177271	Flying Flags Avila Beach	Near Avila Hot Springs for mineral soaking, Edna Valley wineries for tasting. Premium oceanfront RV camping experience.	Cliffside sites overlooking the Pacific with ruby sunrises and cotton candy sunsets. Walk to beach, pier, and waterfront restaurants.	couples_getaway	\N	6450 Babe Ln, Avila Beach, CA 93424, USA	Avila Beach	CA	35.1767387	-120.7547607	ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY	4.5	260	\N	{"hookups": "full"}	t	\N	\N	\N	USD	Premium pricing, book well ahead	\N	3 hours	\N	{"scenic_beauty": 5, "solitude_level": 2, "adventure_level": 2, "family_friendly": 3, "relaxation_factor": 5}	\N	\N	https://www.flyingflagsavilabeach.com/?utm_source=google&utm_medium=organic&utm_campaign=gbp	(805) 888-0158	\N	researching	0	{couples,oceanfront,sunset,beach}	{}	{}	\N	\N	2026-02-02 15:20:43.05+00	2026-02-06 03:27:37.131601+00	[{"name": "places/ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Bd01reGtWSGxuVDFCWGQxVlZSemxaTTBSU1FuYxAB", "text": {"text": "This place was amazing.   The location felt slightly secluded.  There were small beaches within walking distance (including an off-leash dog beach!), and a pier with a popular casual restaurant.    The staff was friendly and kept everything clean.   Every site has an amazing view and we loved the built-in fire pit.\\nThere was so much to do in the area!   Within one hour you can visit cute little towns, beaches and wineries.   Biking trails and hiking, too.   We had so much fun!", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-12-31T16:49:24.597537020Z", "originalText": {"text": "This place was amazing.   The location felt slightly secluded.  There were small beaches within walking distance (including an off-leash dog beach!), and a pier with a popular casual restaurant.    The staff was friendly and kept everything clean.   Every site has an amazing view and we loved the built-in fire pit.\\nThere was so much to do in the area!   Within one hour you can visit cute little towns, beaches and wineries.   Biking trails and hiking, too.   We had so much fun!", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Bd01reGtWSGxuVDFCWGQxVlZSemxaTTBSU1FuYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecf99015d55d0d:0x7681508d5b95b14e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25Bd01reGtWSGxuVDFCWGQxVlZSemxaTTBSU1FuYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102005602893548433998/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWhgJ0Dga3rYF7ZO95oK4vpkmb1IiOo05CaOcvottoX1Jo9RdlK=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Steph Davis"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WalFXaDVWMDAzV1ZocmNrbzFjMDF6YzBsNVNsRRAB", "text": {"text": "Amazing place. They have a very nice and strong wifi. Outlets everwhere in the walk-in tent camps. It is avery nice place, restrooms and showers are great. We asked for extra hand wash in the restrooms but they did not accommodate it for over 32 hours. There were some noisy people next to us, but the quiet hours were enforced and they quited down after 10pm. The staff is very helpful and nice, always ready to help and say good morning and how's your day going every time. The gas fire pits are very nice in both the evenings and the mornings. I very much suggest going up to the lookout point at 8-9 am with a sweater, to get a cup of tea (usually only green tea, I reccomend the bee honey in the tea) or coffee and go down to the community area, and sit by the fire pits and play some games or watch the water. The staff is very nice, and helpful with any issues. We barely had any issues (hand wash) and everything else went smoothly and we enjoyed our stay a lot;", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-11-30T04:36:43.384626444Z", "originalText": {"text": "Amazing place. They have a very nice and strong wifi. Outlets everwhere in the walk-in tent camps. It is avery nice place, restrooms and showers are great. We asked for extra hand wash in the restrooms but they did not accommodate it for over 32 hours. There were some noisy people next to us, but the quiet hours were enforced and they quited down after 10pm. The staff is very helpful and nice, always ready to help and say good morning and how's your day going every time. The gas fire pits are very nice in both the evenings and the mornings. I very much suggest going up to the lookout point at 8-9 am with a sweater, to get a cup of tea (usually only green tea, I reccomend the bee honey in the tea) or coffee and go down to the community area, and sit by the fire pits and play some games or watch the water. The staff is very nice, and helpful with any issues. We barely had any issues (hand wash) and everything else went smoothly and we enjoyed our stay a lot;", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WalFXaDVWMDAzV1ZocmNrbzFjMDF6YzBsNVNsRRAB!2m1!1s0x80ecf99015d55d0d:0x7681508d5b95b14e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25WalFXaDVWMDAzV1ZocmNrbzFjMDF6YzBsNVNsRRAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104591179257527283756/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXnI83TtBH-JPn_lKxovm6gAkbxA2CTrKO74wgilkGRwF6xEyIzUA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Marton Salga"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5b2EyRlVTR2QwYUhKM09HOHlWVWRpUW5SbVQyYxAB", "text": {"text": "This place is top notch for RV spots on the Central Coast. Kind people at check in & the sites are always clean & ready to pull into. The built in gas fire pit is such a nice touch. It's a little higher in price here for camping but compare it to hotels in the area & take a look at the stunning, panoramic coastal views & you won't mind. We live close by but use this as a favorite staycation when we need a break from work 🏖", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-12-25T14:53:59.905839193Z", "originalText": {"text": "This place is top notch for RV spots on the Central Coast. Kind people at check in & the sites are always clean & ready to pull into. The built in gas fire pit is such a nice touch. It's a little higher in price here for camping but compare it to hotels in the area & take a look at the stunning, panoramic coastal views & you won't mind. We live close by but use this as a favorite staycation when we need a break from work 🏖", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5b2EyRlVTR2QwYUhKM09HOHlWVWRpUW5SbVQyYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecf99015d55d0d:0x7681508d5b95b14e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2w5b2EyRlVTR2QwYUhKM09HOHlWVWRpUW5SbVQyYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100440135734282734012/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV1o2eIcDnS_HovFaxA2hlYegswtGz13feJXAIFU0EdUPP40dNd=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3", "displayName": "Shannon Sipes"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a month ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV1pqbHVlbDlGUVd4Q1kyaFdaRFV0Um5SR2JXYxAB", "text": {"text": "This place is amazing and the service is on point. They keep the property clean and the landscaping is beautiful. The views and location make this RV park a little slice of paradise. I would spend every free weekend I had here. I asked the manager to light one of the communal fire pits, but it was going out due to the wind. He brought me and my wife our own propane fire pot and set it up for us. 5 stars definitely rebooking in the future.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-10-05T23:08:35.332179064Z", "originalText": {"text": "This place is amazing and the service is on point. They keep the property clean and the landscaping is beautiful. The views and location make this RV park a little slice of paradise. I would spend every free weekend I had here. I asked the manager to light one of the communal fire pits, but it was going out due to the wind. He brought me and my wife our own propane fire pot and set it up for us. 5 stars definitely rebooking in the future.", "languageCode": "en"}, "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV1pqbHVlbDlGUVd4Q1kyaFdaRFV0Um5SR2JXYxAB!2m1!1s0x80ecf99015d55d0d:0x7681508d5b95b14e", "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tSV1pqbHVlbDlGUVd4Q1kyaFdaRFV0Um5SR2JXYxAB&d=17924085&t=1", "authorAttribution": {"uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112623832429774115947/reviews", "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLbnpguHOxzKbUVJZ8r3PTvHE--FHbWhupOgCD07TDpYQX4Yg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo", "displayName": "Fernando Bichi"}, "relativePublishTimeDescription": "4 months ago"}, {"name": "places/ChIJDV3VFZD57IARTrGVW41QgXY/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xSNFVtTnhTRGx2ZURoRE5XWnBZbEZJYVV3eVVrRRAB", "text": {"text": "We had reservations for a 5 night stay.  Unfortunately I had a medical emergency on day 4 and was hospitalized.   The Avila staff stepped up and assisted my wife with extending our stay and offered other help.\\n\\nBeautiful location and the resort is top notch.  Sites were the best we've ever stayed in.  We will be back.", "languageCode": "en"}, "rating": 5, "publishTime": "2025-11-21T00:00:54.815560650Z", "originalText": {"text": "We had reservations for a 5 night stay.  Un